<view class="workspace" style="{{themeStyle}}"><view class="page-header"><view><text class="page-heading">数据管理</text><text class="subtitle">本机备份、恢复和微信账号同步。</text></view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view wx:if="{{notice}}" class="notice">{{notice}}</view>
  <view class="panel"><text class="section-title">当前空间</text><text class="subtitle">{{loggedIn ? '当前微信账号的本机副本' : '未登录的本机空间'}} · {{count}} 条记录</text><text class="body-copy">{{sync.label}}</text><text wx:if="{{sync.pending}}" class="field-hint">{{sync.pending}} 条修改等待同步</text><text wx:if="{{sync.error}}" class="field-hint">{{sync.error}}</text><button wx:if="{{loggedIn}}" class="action-secondary" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="synchronize">立即同步</button></view>
  <view wx:if="{{sync.status === 'conflict'}}" class="panel"><text class="section-title">同步冲突</text><text class="subtitle">其他设备也改过记录。请先导出备份，再决定保留哪个版本。</text><view class="form-actions"><button class="action-secondary" data-local="yes" bindtap="resolve">保留本机</button><button class="action-secondary" data-local="no" bindtap="resolve">采用云端</button></view></view>
  <view class="panel"><text class="section-title">本机备份</text><text class="subtitle">导出完整个人记录，或从本小程序的备份追加恢复。</text><view class="form-actions"><button class="action-primary" bindtap="exportFile">导出 JSON</button><button class="action-secondary" bindtap="importFile">恢复备份</button></view></view>
  <text class="body-copy">登录前后的本机空间彼此隔离。若要把未登录时的记录带入账号，请先导出本机备份，登录后再恢复。网页端备份格式不同，暂不直接导入。</text>
</view>
